This file has been modified from the original. It was rebuilt as the four-beat
"Command -> Result" preview loop, with its own layout, styling, and GSAP
timeline; the a-roll video and audio elements were removed and a command
placeholder was added for stageProject to stamp. Retained from the original are
the #root composition element and its data attributes, the CSS reset, the
pinned GSAP script tag, and the window.__timelines registration -- the contract
the HyperFrames renderer requires.

